OL,3,GNEWSAPub landlord's murder 'will linger
OL,4,Afor a long time'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFriends of a pub landlord murdered by a
OL,7,Fmember of activist group Raise the
OL,8,FColours have welcomed a guilty verdict
OL,9,Fin the case, but said his death had
OL,10,Fleft the local community in shock.
OL,12,FRuby Marshall, who worked with Matthew
OL,13,FO'Gara at The Plough pub near
OL,14,FLichfield, said she was relieved after
OL,15,FBilly Allison was convicted of murder
OL,16,Fon Wednesday.
OL,18,F"It's a good thing in a bad situation,"
OL,19,Fshe said, "however, it's not going to
OL,20,Fbring Matt back, it never will," she
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
