OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'm happy that some sense of justice
OL,7,Fhas been served for him and his family.
OL,8,FIt still should never have happened and
OL,9,Fthe fact that we were there in the
OL,10,Ffirst place is just horrible," she
OL,11,Fadded.
